### ========================================
### NOTIFICATION SERVICE API TESTS
### ========================================
### Base URL: http://localhost:8081
### Service: Notification Service - Notification Management
### Version: v1
### Note: All endpoints use CurrentUserProvider for authentication
###       No need for X-User-Id header as user context is handled by security layer

### ========================================
### VARIABLES
### ========================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@notificationId = 123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174001
@testDate = 2024-01-01T00:00:00

### ========================================
### NOTIFICATION RETRIEVAL ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

### 1. Get All Notifications (with pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?isDeleted=false&createAt={{testDate}}&limit=10

###

### 2. Get Notifications (without createAt parameter - uses current time)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?isDeleted=false&limit=10

###

### 3. Get Notifications with Large Limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?isDeleted=false&createAt={{testDate}}&limit=50

###

### 4. Get Deleted Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?isDeleted=true&createAt={{testDate}}&limit=10

###

### 5. Count Unread Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/recipient/count-unread

###

### ========================================
### NOTIFICATION UPDATE ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

### 6. Mark All Notifications as Read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/read-all

###

### 7. Mark Specific Notification as Read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read

###

### ========================================
### NOTIFICATION DELETE ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

### 8. Soft Delete Notification (Recommended)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/{{notificationId}}/soft

###

### 9. Hard Delete Notification (Permanent)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/{{notificationId}}/hard

###

### ========================================
### TESTING SCENARIOS
### ========================================

### 10. Test with Different Date Ranges
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?isDeleted=false&createAt=2024-12-01T00:00:00&limit=5

###

### 11. Test with Small Limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?isDeleted=false&createAt={{testDate}}&limit=1

###

### 12. Test with Different Notification ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174002/soft

###

### 13. Test Mark Read with Different Notification ID
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174003/read

###

### ========================================
### ERROR TESTING SCENARIOS
### ========================================

### 14. Test with Invalid Notification ID Format
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?isDeleted=false&createAt={{testDate}}&limit=invalid

###

### 15. Test with Negative Limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?isDeleted=false&createAt={{testDate}}&limit=-1

###

### 16. Test with Very Large Limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?isDeleted=false&createAt={{testDate}}&limit=1000

###
